/P 420 0 R
/ActualText ( Farmers or traders often have to visit corn providers directly to obtain price information and sell corn to traders. This process takes a long time and makes it difficult for farmers to find traders who will buy their corn. Additionally, service providers may not always be present at the required location.)
/Pg 9 0 R
