255 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Based on the obstacles faced in the previous system, the most appropriate solution is to develop a website or information system that will be used by farmers and the people of Toba Regency, especially Balige, Laguboti and Porsea.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
256 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The proposed website will provide benefits for both farmers and the community by simplifying the price prediction process for corn agricultural commodities, including enabling direct communication through the system. With this information system, farmers can obtain accurate and up-to-date price prediction information, so they can plan production and sales better. On the other hand, the public and potential buyers will get access to transparent price information, so they can make wiser purchasing decisions.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
257 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In addition, this system will be equipped with a graphic feature that can be seen by farmers, which displays corn price trends over time. These charts will help farmers to understand price fluctuations and predict future prices based on historical data.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
258 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Not only that, another feature that will be provided is the ability for farmers to sell their corn directly to collectors \(tokke\) through the system. This feature will facilitate direct buying and selling transactions and reduce unnecessary intermediaries, so farmers can get better prices for their products.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
259 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Thus, it is hoped that this information system can improve the welfare of farmers and support overall regional economic development.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
